'''I Want To Be A Teacher''' (先生になりたいでにゃ～る, ''Sensei ni Naritaide Nya~ru'', '''I Want to Become a Teacher''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]].

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Recharge UP (Sm): Cat Cannon will charge 10 seconds faster.

